WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.000
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.200
You're here!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.667
Guys, I'm very excited
about this.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:10.033
Demi Lovato
is my co-host tonight!

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:11.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:13.100
♪♪

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.934
-Come on.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.400
-Yep, last week, I co-hosted
with Megan Thee Stallion,

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.200
and now Demi Lovato.
Yeah, I'm gonna --

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.234
I'm gonna get worried
if NBC says, "Okay.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.801
Now let's just try it
Megan and Demi.

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.033
Jimmy, you get out of the way.
Yeah."

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:29.801
[ Laughter ]
Let's get some news.

00:00:29.801 --> 00:00:32.300
I saw that since the FBI's
search of Mar-A-Lago,

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.200
former President Trump
has been scrambling

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.901
to put together
a team of experienced lawyers,

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:39.400
but everyone
is turning him down.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:43.267
Trump needs to be careful.
If he says, "I'm desperate"

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:45.601
three times in a row,
Rudy Giuliani will appear.

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:49.968
He's like, "Showtime!"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:52.267
But Trump's offer to lawyers
is pretty enticing.

00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:56.534
He's like, "Sure, we'll probably
lose, but I also won't pay you."

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:59.234
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.234 --> 00:01:00.868
Yeah, Trump's
pretty depressed about it.

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:02.000
Tonight, he was on the couch

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.300
working with the law firm
of Ben &amp; Jerry.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:08.367
Meanwhile, the other big
political story is that

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:11.567
Representitive Liz Cheney, who's
on the January 6th committee

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:14.267
and has been outspoken about
Trump's defeat in the election,

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:18.334
lost her primary race to
a challenger that he endorsed.

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:20.634
Trump was so excited,
he threw a ticker-tape parade

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:22.334
made out of
classified documents.

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:23.968
He was like...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:26.734
"Celebrate good times, come on."

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:28.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:30.968
In her concession speech,
Cheney promised to do

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:33.100
whatever it takes
to ensure that Donald Trump

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.000
is never again
anywhere near the Oval Office.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.400
So she's installing a ramp.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:49.601
"These shoes are very slippery."

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:51.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:54.234
You guys see this? Today,
CDC director Rochelle Walensky

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:56.834
said that the agency didn't
respond quickly enough

00:01:56.834 --> 00:02:00.400
to the COVID pandemic and called
for a reorganization.

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.434
Yeah, the CDC said that they
didn't responded quickly enough

00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:03.834
to the pandemic.

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:05.567
They might be on to something
because everyone was like,

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.801
"Sorry. Which of the current
pandemics are you referring to?"

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:08.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:10.434
♪ We're cool for the summer ♪

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:11.601
Guys, you know what that means.

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:14.501
It is time for my amazing
co-host for the evening.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:16.167
Demi Lovato, come out here!

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:17.767
Demi! No!
Come on!

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:20.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:21.868
Come on!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:23.133
-Thank you.

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:26.100
Oh, thank you!
Thank you so much.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.767
-Come on, now.
Oh, wow.

00:02:28.767 --> 00:02:29.934
I didn't even get
a standing ova--

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:32.501
-Thank you.
Oh!

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:35.067
-I didn't even get
a standing ovation like this!

00:02:35.067 --> 00:02:36.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:38.501
-Wow.

00:02:38.501 --> 00:02:41.901
-Thank you so much!
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:41.901 --> 00:02:44.133
Thank you guys so much.

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:46.901
Jimmy, I was wondering, can I
join you for your monologue?

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:48.100
-Of course.
I'd love it.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.434
But there's
so much going on right now.

00:02:49.434 --> 00:02:53.067
I mean, there's --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:55.567
Today, Rudy Giuliani
appeared before a grand jury

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:58.868
in Georgia to testify about
election interference.

00:02:58.868 --> 00:03:01.200
HBO is about to debut
its "Game of Thrones"

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.367
prequel series,
"House of the Dragon."

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:05.334
[ Cheers ]

00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:07.968
-Doctors are telling people
to stop doing a TikTok challenge

00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:10.467
where you tape your mouth shut
while you sleep.

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:12.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.667
And Capri Sun recalled
thousands of drinks

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:16.934
because they might contain
cleaning solution.

00:03:16.934 --> 00:03:18.434
-Yeah, there's a lot to go over.

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:20.033
Let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:21.667
It's time for a "News Smash."

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.501
♪♪

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:26.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:26.467 --> 00:03:28.767
First up,
Rudy Giuliani is in trouble.

00:03:28.767 --> 00:03:31.000
He's the target
of a Georgia investigation

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.734
into election interference.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:33.734 --> 00:03:35.667
When he found out,
Rudy shouted a bunch of words

00:03:35.667 --> 00:03:37.100
that you can only say on...

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.868
-HBO.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.868 --> 00:03:42.734
They're about to debut a huge
new "Game of Thrones" prequel

00:03:42.734 --> 00:03:44.767
called "House of the Dragon."

00:03:44.767 --> 00:03:46.834
It takes place 200 years
before the original,

00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:49.133
and it's a great idea, unlike...

00:03:49.133 --> 00:03:50.767
-Taping your mouth shut
before you go to sleep.

00:03:50.767 --> 00:03:51.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.801 --> 00:03:53.234
People are doing it on TikTok,

00:03:53.234 --> 00:03:55.200
but doctors say
it's bad for your health.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.501
Kind of like...

00:03:56.501 --> 00:03:59.601
-Drinking Capri Sun
spiked with cleaning solution.

00:03:59.601 --> 00:04:01.334
They've recalled
thousands of drinks,

00:04:01.334 --> 00:04:04.167
not to mention those pouches,
which can often...

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:05.467
-Leak. Rudy...

00:04:05.467 --> 00:04:08.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.434 --> 00:04:09.901
...does it all the time.

00:04:09.901 --> 00:04:12.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:12.901 --> 00:04:14.501
Now he's under investigation

00:04:14.501 --> 00:04:16.667
by the state of Georgia
and the feds.

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.734
I mean, there's no way that guy
is getting much...

00:04:18.734 --> 00:04:20.567
-Sleep.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.567 --> 00:04:23.767
Come on, TikTok.
Mouth tape, tortilla slapping,

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:25.367
the face-wax challenge.

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:27.934
Seems like the only thing
y'all don't allow is...

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:31.501
-Nudity. "House of the Dragon"
will have lots of it.

00:04:31.501 --> 00:04:34.300
So fingers crossed
none of the actors look like...

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.400
-Rudy Giuliani.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:43.868
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:04:43.868 --> 00:04:45.801
I mean, just look at that face.

00:04:45.801 --> 00:04:47.868
That guy
could definitely use some...

00:04:47.868 --> 00:04:49.801
-Cleaning solution.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.801 --> 00:04:51.801
Drinking that would be gross.

00:04:51.801 --> 00:04:53.300
Almost as gross as...

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:56.234
