00:08:11.033 --> 00:08:12.601
I mean, they gotta know
it's "Holy F--"

00:08:12.601 --> 00:08:15.067
-Flamin' Hot Cheetos.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:15.067 --> 00:08:18.467
-No. No, it's "Holy F--"
-Frank Sinatra.

00:08:18.467 --> 00:08:19.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:19.634 --> 00:08:21.534
-Jimmy, come on.
Don't be silly.

00:08:21.534 --> 00:08:23.801
IT'S "Holy F--"
-"Friends" on NBC.

00:08:23.801 --> 00:08:24.968
[ Laughter ]

00:08:24.968 --> 00:08:27.033
-"Holy F--"
-Fuhget about it!

00:08:27.033 --> 00:08:28.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:28.901 --> 00:08:30.734
-"Holy --"
-♪ First, I was afraid ♪

00:08:30.734 --> 00:08:32.367
♪ I was petrified ♪

00:08:32.367 --> 00:08:33.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:33.701 --> 00:08:35.000
-"Holy --"
-Family.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.567
When you're here, you're it.

00:08:36.567 --> 00:08:37.634
That's Olive Garden.

00:08:37.634 --> 00:08:40.133
Unlimited breadsticks,
amazing soups.

00:08:40.133 --> 00:08:42.667
So many things.
-Jimmy, enough.

00:08:42.667 --> 00:08:43.868
You can say it just once.

00:08:43.868 --> 00:08:46.367
I promise.
They told me it was okay.

00:08:46.367 --> 00:08:49.133
-Really?
I can say the title?

00:08:49.133 --> 00:08:50.767
If you say so.
[ Clears throat ]

00:08:50.767 --> 00:08:52.534
Demi's new album,
"Holy F--"

00:08:52.534 --> 00:08:54.033
♪♪

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:57.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:57.968 --> 00:09:00.968
